{"dur": 29.83, "fps": 30, "segments": [{"id": "hook", "text": "Ces deux-là n'auraient jamais dû marcher ensemble.", "t0": 1.2, "t1": 3.604, "words": [{"w": "Ces", "t": 1.2}, {"w": "deux-là", "t": 1.396}, {"w": "n'auraient", "t": 1.74}, {"w": "jamais", "t": 2.279}, {"w": "dû", "t": 2.623}, {"w": "marcher", "t": 2.77}, {"w": "ensemble.", "t": 3.163}]}, {"id": "beton", "text": "Le béton : très fort quand on l'écrase. Il casse net quand on le tire.", "t0": 4.404, "t1": 9.16, "words": [{"w": "Le", "t": 4.404}, {"w": "béton", "t": 4.614}, {"w": ":", "t": 5.034}, {"w": "très", "t": 5.104}, {"w": "fort", "t": 5.453}, {"w": "quand", "t": 5.803}, {"w": "on", "t": 6.223}, {"w": "l'écrase.", "t": 6.432}, {"w": "Il", "t": 7.062}, {"w": "casse", "t": 7.272}, {"w": "net", "t": 7.691}, {"w": "quand", "t": 7.971}, {"w": "on", "t": 8.391}, {"w": "le", "t": 8.601}, {"w": "tire.", "t": 8.811}]}, {"id": "acier", "text": "L'acier : très fort quand on le tire. Mais seul, il flambe et il rouille.", "t0": 9.54, "t1": 13.688, "words": [{"w": "L'acier", "t": 9.54}, {"w": ":", "t": 10.014}, {"w": "très", "t": 10.073}, {"w": "fort", "t": 10.37}, {"w": "quand", "t": 10.666}, {"w": "on", "t": 11.021}, {"w": "le", "t": 11.199}, {"w": "tire.", "t": 11.377}, {"w": "Mais", "t": 11.673}, {"w": "seul,", "t": 11.969}, {"w": "il", "t": 12.266}, {"w": "flambe", "t": 12.443}, {"w": "et", "t": 12.858}, {"w": "il", "t": 13.036}, {"w": "rouille.", "t": 13.214}]}, {"id": "magie", "text": "Et pourtant ça marche. En chauffant, les deux s'allongent presque pareil. Ils ne se décollent jamais.", "t0": 14.068, "t1": 19.774, "words": [{"w": "Et", "t": 14.068}, {"w": "pourtant", "t": 14.242}, {"w": "ça", "t": 14.766}, {"w": "marche.", "t": 14.941}, {"w": "En", "t": 15.349}, {"w": "chauffant,", "t": 15.523}, {"w": "les", "t": 16.106}, {"w": "deux", "t": 16.339}, {"w": "s'allongent", "t": 16.63}, {"w": "presque", "t": 17.329}, {"w": "pareil.", "t": 17.794}, {"w": "Ils", "t": 18.202}, {"w": "ne", "t": 18.435}, {"w": "se"